WEBVTT

00:01.297 --> 00:02.717
♪

00:05.887 --> 00:07.137
♪

00:11.267 --> 00:13.647
[SATOKO] Women are their
families' property,

00:13.727 --> 00:16.607
a currency to be gifted
or exchanged.

00:17.277 --> 00:20.447
They do not have a choice
in matters of marriage.

00:20.527 --> 00:23.027
But I did choose,

00:23.447 --> 00:27.157
of my own free will,
even though it was forbidden.

00:27.907 --> 00:29.617
I loved someone...

00:31.577 --> 00:34.707
and I was truly happy.

00:37.087 --> 00:39.297
[♪ opening theme song playing]

02:13.267 --> 02:16.437
[birds chirping]

02:16.517 --> 02:18.437
♪

02:21.227 --> 02:22.817
[GARDENER] Oh, look!

02:22.897 --> 02:24.857
Quit your staring
and get back to work.

02:24.947 --> 02:26.237
Can you blame me?

02:26.317 --> 02:28.817
It's a rare day you see her
step foot outside.

02:28.907 --> 02:30.987
How often do I get the chance?

02:31.617 --> 02:32.697
[SATOKO] Mm?

02:32.787 --> 02:34.037
[both exclaim]

02:34.117 --> 02:35.957
Thank you for your hard work.

02:36.457 --> 02:38.497
[GARDENER 1] Oh! [exhales]

02:38.577 --> 02:41.167
-[gasps softly]
-A goddess spoke to me.

02:41.797 --> 02:42.797
♪

02:45.377 --> 02:46.387
[Satoko chuckles softly]

02:46.837 --> 02:48.757
[MIWAKO] Oh, sister!

02:48.847 --> 02:49.757
[SATOKO] Hm?

02:50.467 --> 02:52.637
Just what do you think
you're doing out here?

02:52.717 --> 02:55.347
You know full well
you have a weak heart.

02:55.437 --> 02:56.937
Imagine if you collapsed

02:57.017 --> 02:58.647
during your meeting
with a suitor tomorrow!

02:58.727 --> 02:59.727
What meeting?

03:00.107 --> 03:02.357
No, don't tell me you forgot
about Lord Hatano.

03:02.437 --> 03:04.647
Or were you trying to be mindful

03:04.737 --> 03:06.357
of your little sister's
feelings?

03:06.447 --> 03:07.987
There's no need.

03:08.067 --> 03:10.907
I wasn't good enough,
so he chose you instead.

03:10.987 --> 03:12.447
Aw, poor Miwako.

03:12.537 --> 03:13.617
It'll be all right.

03:14.197 --> 03:15.957
Father received
his marriage proposal

03:16.037 --> 03:17.247
and turned it down outright.

03:17.327 --> 03:20.247
What? But his family's
so well-known.

03:20.327 --> 03:22.797
What could Father
have possibly objected to?

03:23.297 --> 03:26.127
I don't know,
nor is it for me to say,

03:26.217 --> 03:28.467
as I plan to marry
whomever Father chooses.

03:28.547 --> 03:30.927
But doesn't that feel
so empty to you?

03:31.007 --> 03:33.597
While upper-class girls
have to marry politically,

03:33.677 --> 03:36.477
I hear commoners' daughters
get to marry for love.

03:36.557 --> 03:38.387
It makes me so envious.

03:38.477 --> 03:40.437
If I had been the one
that he chose,

03:40.517 --> 03:42.897
I'm certain Lord Hatano
would've fallen for me.

03:43.647 --> 03:46.527
If you've got something to say,
go on and say it.

03:46.607 --> 03:47.567
[Miwako chuckles]

03:48.237 --> 03:49.487
Pretty flowers.

03:49.987 --> 03:52.027
I hear you're growing them
for Father?

03:52.527 --> 03:54.157
His birthday is coming up.

03:54.867 --> 03:57.197
All this flattery, and for what?

03:57.287 --> 04:00.037
You want what's mine,
so you rob me,

04:00.127 --> 04:02.957
from Father's affections
to my very soulmate.

04:03.037 --> 04:04.207
[MIWAKO'S FRIEND] It's terrible.

04:04.297 --> 04:07.087
I rob you?
What a disgraceful thing to say.

04:07.167 --> 04:08.047
[MIWAKO] Huh?

04:08.627 --> 04:11.677
He simply didn't want you,
that's all there is to it.

04:12.927 --> 04:14.047
[Miwako chuckles]

04:14.137 --> 04:15.757
Tell me, dear sister,

04:15.847 --> 04:17.557
the gentlemen
who ask for your hand

04:17.637 --> 04:19.347
don't know the truth, do they?

04:19.437 --> 04:21.557
About how you're only
counting down the days

04:21.647 --> 04:23.227
until your lousy heart
gives out.

04:25.767 --> 04:26.857
One of the maids said

04:26.937 --> 04:28.567
while she was
cleaning your room,

04:28.647 --> 04:30.527
she came across something.

04:30.607 --> 04:32.697
You've written your will.

04:33.197 --> 04:35.777
You'd better stay put
in your room as much as you can.

04:35.867 --> 04:37.157
Don't you wanna live long enough

04:37.247 --> 04:39.407
to finally get married off?
[grunts]

04:39.497 --> 04:41.877
Listen carefully to what I say.

04:41.957 --> 04:44.877
The proposal came
from Lord Hatano's whole family.

04:44.957 --> 04:47.757
Lately, you've been eager
to ignore your betterment

04:47.837 --> 04:49.257
in favor of your enjoyment.

04:49.587 --> 04:52.887
Meanwhile, I've been working to
cultivate my elegance and grace.

04:52.967 --> 04:55.137
Each step I take
has been refined.

04:55.217 --> 04:58.097
Now, my diligence
has been rewarded.

04:58.177 --> 05:00.807
Yes, I'm a burden,
but I strive to add value.

05:00.887 --> 05:03.147
The will the maid found
is merely an extension

05:03.227 --> 05:04.147
of that desire.

05:04.227 --> 05:06.517
[scoffs] You think
that's enough?

05:06.607 --> 05:07.607
[Miwako's friends gasp softly]

05:07.687 --> 05:09.317
Regardless, you should focus

05:09.397 --> 05:11.357
on getting your own affairs
in order.

05:11.447 --> 05:13.407
You're pretty, I grant you.

05:13.487 --> 05:16.327
But otherwise, you have
no good qualities.

05:16.407 --> 05:17.327
[all gasp]

05:17.407 --> 05:18.997
Huh? What did you say?

05:19.077 --> 05:21.157
I said your personality's awful.

05:21.247 --> 05:24.627
Unless something changes,
you'll never find a husband.

05:24.707 --> 05:26.707
But I wish you the best.

05:26.797 --> 05:29.257
[gasps] How dare you!

05:29.337 --> 05:31.717
Mother's going to hear
all about this.

05:33.047 --> 05:34.137
[Satoko grunts]

05:36.347 --> 05:38.717
Perhaps I got a little
too worked up.

05:39.307 --> 05:40.847
I should go inside.

05:43.517 --> 05:45.227
Shortly after I was born,

05:45.687 --> 05:49.277
my mother died,
and my father remarried.

05:53.397 --> 05:57.617
Then, he and my stepmother
had a new child, Miwako.

05:57.697 --> 06:00.197
The four of us
have lived together since.

06:01.157 --> 06:04.247
I have
a naturally weak constitution.

06:04.327 --> 06:08.247
"Her life will likely be short."
That's what the doctors told us.

06:08.797 --> 06:12.297
In spite of that, I've received
many offers for marriage,

06:12.377 --> 06:15.757
which drives Miwako mad.
Although...

06:15.837 --> 06:19.507
My sister's hate can't hold
a candle to hers.

06:19.597 --> 06:20.717
My stepmother...

06:21.637 --> 06:24.807
She thinks I'm interfering
with her daughter's prospects.

06:25.637 --> 06:28.727
I have only one ally
in this house.

06:30.647 --> 06:31.777
Father?

06:31.857 --> 06:32.817
[JUBEI] Mm?

06:35.317 --> 06:37.867
Did I hear you and your sister
got in a fight again?

06:37.947 --> 06:39.327
What do you expect me to do

06:39.407 --> 06:41.367
when she keeps provoking me
like she does?

06:41.447 --> 06:42.997
My, my, I've raised

06:43.077 --> 06:45.537
quite the firecracker
of a daughter, haven't I?

06:45.617 --> 06:46.707
[Satoko chuckles]

06:47.127 --> 06:48.917
-Satoko...
-Mm?

06:48.997 --> 06:52.167
I've received another
marriage proposal for you.

06:52.257 --> 06:54.667
A son of one of my friends
is interested.

06:54.757 --> 06:56.547
Would you like to meet with him?

06:57.007 --> 06:58.337
[Satoko chuckles softly]

06:58.427 --> 07:00.887
Does he know about the health
of his would-be bride?

07:01.637 --> 07:04.597
-Hmm, not yet.
-Of course not.

07:04.677 --> 07:06.727
He wouldn't want a wife
in my condition.

07:06.807 --> 07:08.727
But I refuse to lie...

07:09.187 --> 07:11.067
not to one
who could be my husband.

07:13.027 --> 07:15.857
Hmm. My dear girl,

07:15.947 --> 07:18.107
if you're to lead a happy life,

07:18.197 --> 07:21.407
you'll need support
and money for your medical care.

07:21.487 --> 07:24.327
This old man
can't protect you forever.

07:24.407 --> 07:26.407
You might think me
the nagging father

07:26.497 --> 07:28.327
always talking of marriage,

07:28.417 --> 07:30.377
but I hope you can understand.

07:30.457 --> 07:32.167
I can't help
but want what's best

07:32.247 --> 07:34.007
for my darling daughter.

07:34.627 --> 07:35.707
You've been blessed

07:35.797 --> 07:38.637
with a prestigious
Kirigaya name, dear.

07:38.717 --> 07:40.587
Not to mention your beauty.

07:41.507 --> 07:43.387
You'll find a man,

07:43.467 --> 07:46.227
one who will love
and cherish you.

07:46.307 --> 07:49.017
Father, can't we leave
my appearance out of this?

07:49.097 --> 07:50.397
You're embarrassing me.

07:50.477 --> 07:53.767
Satoko, the doctors may say
you'll die young,

07:53.857 --> 07:56.357
but I won't believe them
so readily.

07:56.437 --> 07:59.907
You will live. I'm sure of it.

08:01.237 --> 08:02.617
[SATOKO] Father...

08:03.327 --> 08:04.787
Ever since I was little,

08:04.867 --> 08:07.497
he's worried about my health
more than anyone.

08:08.787 --> 08:10.537
He's asked for nothing,

08:11.127 --> 08:14.377
except that I marry
and find happiness.

08:14.457 --> 08:15.957
That's his wish.

08:17.047 --> 08:18.087
But...

08:18.627 --> 08:20.637
would any man
willingly take a bride

08:20.717 --> 08:24.257
who needs so much medical care?
I doubt it.

08:26.557 --> 08:28.557
I would like some time
to consider.

08:28.637 --> 08:30.977
-[JUBEI] Hmm.
-Not to change the subject,

08:31.057 --> 08:32.187
-but...
-Hmm?

08:32.607 --> 08:34.857
I'd like to take a trip
into town, if that's all right.

08:34.937 --> 08:35.817
You would?

08:35.897 --> 08:37.607
But what could you need there?

08:37.687 --> 08:39.777
Nothing important, really.

08:39.857 --> 08:41.907
What if something happens
and you collapse while you're--

08:41.987 --> 08:45.077
Oh, I know! How about
I take Kotaro along? Huh?

08:46.537 --> 08:48.617
[chuckles]
Whatever will I do with you?

08:48.707 --> 08:49.957
[Jubei chuckles]

08:52.037 --> 08:55.247
Kotaro, father never
lets me out like this.

08:55.337 --> 08:56.667
Can you believe it?

08:56.757 --> 08:58.417
It is nice.

08:58.837 --> 09:00.377
[SATOKO] Oh, this is it.

09:01.217 --> 09:04.047
Would you mind
if I spent some time alone here?

09:04.137 --> 09:06.257
Very well.
There's an errand His Lordship

09:06.347 --> 09:08.887
requested me to run
while we're out. I'll do that.

09:08.977 --> 09:10.307
Please take your time.

09:10.387 --> 09:11.637
-Uh?
-Stay out of sunlight.

09:12.437 --> 09:14.687
And don't do anything
to exert yourself.

09:14.767 --> 09:16.647
Alert me at once
if you feel unwell,

09:16.727 --> 09:17.687
and we'll return home.

09:18.187 --> 09:20.687
And most importantly,
don't leave here without me.

09:22.647 --> 09:25.527
[SATOKO] Why is Kotaro
always such a worrywart?

09:28.197 --> 09:29.907
Now, which should I get?

09:31.287 --> 09:35.287
The flowers are colorful,
so maybe a more neutral vase.

09:36.167 --> 09:37.997
I'll arrange them
with extra care.

09:41.337 --> 09:45.507
Although, it would be a shame
to pluck something so pretty.

09:46.007 --> 09:48.307
I'll just take Father
to see them instead.

09:48.927 --> 09:52.387
I don't want to waste a life,
even for a present.

09:53.517 --> 09:55.187
I can't help
but want what's best

09:55.267 --> 09:56.937
for my darling daughter.

09:57.767 --> 09:59.607
[SATOKO] But what's "best?"

10:00.107 --> 10:02.147
Is there someone
who could accept me,

10:02.647 --> 10:04.397
who meets father's approval?

10:04.987 --> 10:08.907
Someone who loves me,
who I could love in return?

10:08.987 --> 10:10.327
♪

10:10.407 --> 10:11.447
[chuckles]

10:11.907 --> 10:13.497
I might be too greedy.

10:13.997 --> 10:16.287
I doubt such a person exists.

10:16.377 --> 10:17.377
[gasps]

10:17.457 --> 10:20.627
[goons chuckle]

10:21.457 --> 10:23.377
[SATOKO] It was June 27th.

10:23.467 --> 10:26.137
Lady Satoko,
we should head back soon. Uh?

10:27.047 --> 10:28.887
[SATOKO]
I'll never forget that date.

10:29.807 --> 10:32.557
The day those strange men
abducted me.

10:32.637 --> 10:33.847
♪

10:39.107 --> 10:42.357
[MITSUEDA]
Oh, wow, this is the girl?

10:42.987 --> 10:45.067
She's a real looker now,
ain't she?

10:45.147 --> 10:46.987
[SATOKO] Who are these people?

10:47.067 --> 10:50.077
They blindfolded me on the way.
Where am I?

10:50.157 --> 10:51.407
Where's Goto?

10:51.487 --> 10:52.447
[door opens]

10:52.537 --> 10:54.707
Looks like he just got back.

10:54.787 --> 10:55.747
You see?

10:56.537 --> 10:57.787
♪

11:00.037 --> 11:01.127
[SATOKO] Mm?

11:07.967 --> 11:09.467
[heart pounding]

11:17.017 --> 11:18.477
You finish him?

11:19.397 --> 11:20.477
Yeah.

11:21.147 --> 11:22.187
[chuckles]

11:22.727 --> 11:24.937
That guy's been giving us
the run-around for over a week,

11:25.027 --> 11:26.487
and it only takes you one day?

11:26.567 --> 11:29.527
Those fellas who called you
a legend weren't kidding,

11:29.617 --> 11:31.197
you're the real deal.

11:31.657 --> 11:33.287
Anyway,
if you're ready for more,

11:33.367 --> 11:35.327
then I've got some work for you.

11:35.957 --> 11:38.367
See the girl? Kill her for me.

11:38.457 --> 11:39.957
[Satoko gasps]

11:40.747 --> 11:43.127
We ain't ready
to kill her right away, though.

11:43.207 --> 11:46.467
Client's orders on that one,
so keep an eye on her for a bit.

11:46.547 --> 11:49.717
That said,
9:00 sharp, you do it.

11:49.797 --> 11:50.887
[Satoko gasps]

11:50.967 --> 11:52.717
[MITSUEDA]
Shame we can't sell her.

11:52.797 --> 11:55.177
But the client's got
some really deep pockets,

11:55.267 --> 11:56.727
so we just gotta do our job.

11:56.807 --> 11:58.477
The payout's gonna be obscene.

12:00.097 --> 12:01.397
[SHINPEI] All right then.

12:01.977 --> 12:03.107
[breathes shakily]

12:03.187 --> 12:04.647
[MITSUEDA] Now listen up,

12:04.727 --> 12:07.567
none of you even think
about raping that girl.

12:07.647 --> 12:10.697
This guy will carve you up
if you lay a finger on her.

12:10.777 --> 12:12.237
[ALL] Fine.

12:13.697 --> 12:15.157
[laughter]

12:15.247 --> 12:17.577
He was talking back,
so I taught him a lesson.

12:17.657 --> 12:20.287
-[laughter continues]
-[GOON 1] Sure you did.

12:20.377 --> 12:21.327
[chuckles]

12:30.967 --> 12:32.547
-[SHINPEI] Want some?
-Mm?

12:35.717 --> 12:38.517
So, hey, what did you do
to wind up in here?

12:38.597 --> 12:40.267
♪

12:44.057 --> 12:45.067
[SATOKO] Mm?

12:47.857 --> 12:49.027
[gasping]

12:58.997 --> 13:01.037
You sure are beautiful,
aren't you?

13:01.707 --> 13:03.997
So pale, like a ghost.

13:04.087 --> 13:05.207
[SATOKO] Who is he?

13:05.287 --> 13:09.467
What's with him?
His eyes are looking my way,

13:09.547 --> 13:11.967
but it's like he's staring
straight through me.

13:12.967 --> 13:14.097
I'm scared.

13:14.177 --> 13:15.967
So, tell me.

13:16.047 --> 13:18.677
Uh, I haven't done anything
to wind up in here.

13:18.767 --> 13:21.137
There's been a mistake.
Please, you must let me go.

13:21.227 --> 13:23.017
No can do, I'm afraid.

13:23.097 --> 13:26.397
I'm here working, see,
and my job's to kill you.

13:26.477 --> 13:28.897
[SATOKO] Now what?
I have to do something.

13:29.647 --> 13:32.737
But how?
It can't be long till 9:00.

13:32.817 --> 13:35.407
Is there nothing I can say
to convince you?

13:35.867 --> 13:37.027
[SHINPEI] Hmm...

13:37.657 --> 13:39.287
I could be persuaded.

13:39.367 --> 13:41.157
Just pay me more
than these guys are.

13:41.247 --> 13:42.787
I've got no allegiances here.

13:42.867 --> 13:44.037
[Satoko gasps]

13:44.127 --> 13:45.997
[distant laughter]

13:46.087 --> 13:48.587
[SATOKO] Would one man's help
really make a difference?

13:48.667 --> 13:50.047
There's so many.

13:50.877 --> 13:52.297
But still...

13:52.377 --> 13:54.047
Work for me instead.

13:54.137 --> 13:56.637
I have nothing with me,
but I come from a rich family.

13:56.717 --> 13:57.927
-Once I'm home--
-Why would I trust you?

13:58.007 --> 13:59.717
This kimono would sell
for a good price.

13:59.807 --> 14:00.847
I'll pass.

14:01.477 --> 14:02.637
It's decent, but I think

14:02.727 --> 14:04.187
these guys will wind up
paying better.

14:04.267 --> 14:05.727
Don't go.

14:06.267 --> 14:08.647
[OZOE] Hey, brat, move it.

14:09.397 --> 14:10.737
-[laughter]
-Yeah, good.

14:10.817 --> 14:12.607
Now don't make a fuss.

14:12.687 --> 14:14.027
[breathes shakily]

14:14.647 --> 14:15.737
♪

14:15.817 --> 14:17.027
[whimpers]

14:17.327 --> 14:18.657
-[thudding]
-[SATOKO] No!

14:18.737 --> 14:20.747
Stop it, I'm begging you!

14:20.827 --> 14:22.747
Hey, uh, are you sure
about this?

14:22.827 --> 14:25.457
[OZOE] No one needs to know.
She's gonna die.

14:25.537 --> 14:26.577
[screams]

14:26.667 --> 14:28.247
You bitch!

14:28.957 --> 14:30.917
Hold her down for me.
I'll make it quick.

14:32.627 --> 14:33.837
[SATOKO] This is awful.

14:34.467 --> 14:36.547
I can't lose my chastity.

14:36.637 --> 14:38.007
I won't be able to marry.

14:39.387 --> 14:40.887
Father...

14:40.967 --> 14:41.887
♪

14:41.967 --> 14:44.307
I still want to repay you.

14:44.387 --> 14:46.897
Father's only wish is
for me to marry.

14:46.977 --> 14:48.687
I want to make it come true.

14:48.767 --> 14:52.647
That's it. That's the only goal
I've ever had.

14:53.777 --> 14:56.447
If I die here
without making him happy,

14:58.027 --> 15:00.777
my entire life
will have been meaningless.

15:01.577 --> 15:02.747
Hey, you guys.

15:02.827 --> 15:03.827
[gasps]

15:03.907 --> 15:06.077
Sorry, but I'm supposed
to chop up

15:06.157 --> 15:07.827
anyone who lays
a hand on the girl.

15:07.917 --> 15:09.537
-[OZOE] Huh?
-Are you first?

15:09.627 --> 15:12.127
Oh, shut your mouth.
You think you scare me

15:12.207 --> 15:14.087
just 'cause they call you
a "legend--"

15:15.507 --> 15:16.547
[Ozoe gasps]

15:16.627 --> 15:18.047
[screams]

15:19.467 --> 15:20.847
[goons screaming]

15:21.807 --> 15:23.677
[whimpers] Don't hurt me.

15:23.767 --> 15:25.557
I haven't even
done anything yet.

15:25.637 --> 15:27.557
So go ahead and do it then.

15:27.637 --> 15:30.057
I'll just take a limb
for each time you touch her.

15:30.147 --> 15:31.897
[gasps, pants]

15:34.567 --> 15:37.397
[SATOKO] I need to think.
How do I survive this?

15:38.357 --> 15:41.327
I want to live. I can't give up.

15:41.407 --> 15:44.077
I've got to get him on my side.

15:44.157 --> 15:47.287
So what'll convince him
I'm more valuable to keep alive?

15:47.367 --> 15:50.497
I need something. Anything.

15:50.587 --> 15:52.787
What do I have that's valuable?

15:52.877 --> 15:54.007
You've been blessed

15:54.087 --> 15:56.167
with the prestigious
Kirigaya name, dear.

15:56.257 --> 15:57.377
[Satoko gasps]

15:58.297 --> 16:00.137
-It's me.
-Hmm?

16:01.257 --> 16:03.467
I happen to be
a valuable person myself.

16:04.887 --> 16:06.727
Just get me out of here alive.

16:06.807 --> 16:08.597
You can have
everything you want.

16:08.687 --> 16:11.557
Let's get married.
I'll give my all to you.

16:11.647 --> 16:12.687
[SHINPEI] Uh?

16:14.187 --> 16:15.357
Married?

16:15.437 --> 16:17.737
Yes, I've fallen head over heels
for you.

16:19.147 --> 16:21.817
[laughs]
You say some funny things.

16:21.907 --> 16:23.407
My father is a count,

16:23.487 --> 16:25.827
so that makes me a noblewoman
of marrying age.

16:25.907 --> 16:27.497
If you become my husband,

16:27.577 --> 16:28.957
you'd never want
for anything again.

16:29.037 --> 16:31.077
And what made you
fall in love with me?

16:31.167 --> 16:33.537
Huh? Oh, uh, I...

16:33.627 --> 16:35.587
I love how you're so punctual.

16:35.667 --> 16:40.007
Uh, and you were generous,
sharing your food with me.

16:43.047 --> 16:44.217
[footsteps]

16:44.297 --> 16:46.137
Hey, Goto! The hell'd you do?

16:46.217 --> 16:48.307
They tried to rape the girl,
so I cut them up

16:48.387 --> 16:49.677
-like I was told.
-[all gasp]

16:49.767 --> 16:51.597
[GOON] We were ordered
to keep our hands off her!

16:51.687 --> 16:53.227
-You stupid or what?
-Who cares?

16:53.307 --> 16:55.227
We're gonna
kill her soon anyway.

16:55.317 --> 16:57.897
We could just rape her
and keep quiet about it.

16:57.987 --> 16:59.607
We've done it before.

16:59.687 --> 17:01.107
No one's ever found out.

17:01.197 --> 17:03.317
[evil laughter]

17:05.447 --> 17:06.827
Aw, come on.

17:07.577 --> 17:08.537
[Satoko gasps]

17:09.197 --> 17:10.537
[SHINPEI] You're all terrible.

17:10.617 --> 17:11.577
[all gasp]

17:11.867 --> 17:13.877
You should take your jobs
more seriously.

17:13.957 --> 17:15.377
[Satoko chuckles]

17:15.917 --> 17:17.747
[SATOKO] What are you gonna do?

17:18.257 --> 17:19.757
You're a damn fool!

17:20.837 --> 17:24.347
[screaming]

17:27.927 --> 17:29.017
Hmm?

17:29.097 --> 17:30.227
[breathing heavily]

17:30.307 --> 17:32.187
Oh, amazing, you're alive!

17:33.557 --> 17:34.897
Now that we're out of there...

17:35.437 --> 17:37.277
I would like to hear
a little more about your offer.

17:38.067 --> 17:39.817
[SATOKO]
He actually took the bait?

17:40.357 --> 17:41.947
Get me out of here safely.

17:42.027 --> 17:44.067
As a reward, I'll give you
my hand in marriage.

17:44.157 --> 17:47.367
I see. And would this be
a loveless marriage?

17:47.447 --> 17:49.157
[SATOKO]
Do you really have to ask?

17:49.237 --> 17:51.037
I know you only care
about the money.

17:51.117 --> 17:53.287
We could go with something else
if you'd rather.

17:53.367 --> 17:54.327
Name your price.

17:54.707 --> 17:56.087
-[GOON 1] There they are!
-[GOON 2] Found 'em!

17:56.167 --> 17:58.377
-That bitch is ours.
-We're gonna ruin you.

17:58.457 --> 18:00.587
[SATOKO]
They've already caught up?

18:00.667 --> 18:04.137
Well, why don't we
exchange our vows?

18:04.927 --> 18:06.297
In what way?

18:06.387 --> 18:08.217
I was thinking a kiss would do.

18:08.887 --> 18:09.967
[Satoko gasps softly]

18:10.057 --> 18:12.227
You said you're in love with me.

18:12.927 --> 18:14.057
[SATOKO] Mmm.

18:14.597 --> 18:17.477
It's fine.
We're getting married, right?

18:17.567 --> 18:20.317
Of course, but I'd like
to preserve my virtue as a lady

18:20.397 --> 18:21.987
until we're able
to make it official.

18:22.067 --> 18:23.567
We can't be kissing too early.

18:23.647 --> 18:25.947
What matters more, your virtue,

18:26.027 --> 18:27.617
-or your life?
-Uh?

18:27.697 --> 18:30.617
[yelling]

18:31.867 --> 18:33.037
[grunts]

18:34.497 --> 18:36.077
[exclaiming]

18:38.127 --> 18:39.377
[grunting]

18:54.477 --> 18:55.727
-[squelching]
-[gasps]

18:55.807 --> 18:56.977
[groaning]

18:57.057 --> 18:58.307
[SHINPEI] It's all right.

18:59.397 --> 19:01.977
You don't have to kiss me
if you don't want to.

19:04.777 --> 19:06.527
What happens if I don't?

19:06.607 --> 19:09.407
Then I'll just kill you at 9:00,
like I'm supposed to.

19:11.787 --> 19:13.617
[grunting]

19:14.657 --> 19:16.577
[SATOKO]
Why did everything get so quiet?

19:18.247 --> 19:19.497
[grunting]

19:20.747 --> 19:22.877
[SATOKO] All I can hear
is my own heartbeat.

19:25.417 --> 19:27.427
It's pounding so loudly...

19:27.927 --> 19:30.097
as if it's begging me
to run away.

19:36.977 --> 19:38.897
[SHINPEI]
Why are you so hesitant?

19:39.647 --> 19:41.937
Guess you were lying
about falling for me.

19:42.017 --> 19:43.187
That's really a shame.

19:43.277 --> 19:44.687
No, it's just--

19:44.777 --> 19:46.397
Are you scared of me?

19:46.487 --> 19:48.487
I bet a rich girl like you

19:48.567 --> 19:50.617
has never seen
this much blood before.

19:50.697 --> 19:53.947
Must be nice, living your life
in the lap of luxury.

19:54.697 --> 19:57.577
You never have to worry
about your future, do you?

20:01.127 --> 20:02.207
[SATOKO] Come again?

20:02.707 --> 20:04.167
What do you know?

20:26.817 --> 20:28.107
Pardon me.

20:28.187 --> 20:30.817
I didn't want another person's
blood in my mouth.

20:30.907 --> 20:32.867
That would be poor hygiene.

20:35.197 --> 20:37.827
And I don't even have a future.

20:37.907 --> 20:41.037
My heart is defective,
so my days are numbered.

20:41.127 --> 20:42.917
-Naturally...
-[groaning]

20:42.997 --> 20:45.957
...I spend every day
preparing myself for the worst.

20:46.587 --> 20:48.377
[yelling]

20:50.927 --> 20:52.177
[Satoko gasps softly]

20:52.757 --> 20:54.347
Let's get married.

20:54.427 --> 20:55.507
[SATOKO] Mm?

20:55.597 --> 20:57.597
To think you really kissed me

20:57.677 --> 20:59.807
after watching me kill
all those guys...

20:59.887 --> 21:01.807
I need you for me.

21:01.897 --> 21:03.897
I've been
with other women before,

21:03.977 --> 21:06.687
but they all ran away
when they learned my job.

21:06.777 --> 21:09.027
I had to kill them
to keep them quiet.

21:09.107 --> 21:11.777
But you...
You accept me as I am!

21:11.857 --> 21:14.367
I'm sure we're soulmates!

21:15.407 --> 21:18.447
Honestly,
my love is a bit intense.

21:21.577 --> 21:23.827
But I swear I'll make you happy.

21:24.997 --> 21:27.377
[♪ closing theme song playing]
